A service registers this filter:
from ddtrace.trace import tracer, TraceFilter

class DropHealthChecks(TraceFilter):
    def process_trace(self, trace):
        for span in trace:
            if span.resource == "GET /health":
                return None
        return trace

tracer.configure(trace_processors=[DropHealthChecks()])
What happens to a trace in which one span has resource `GET /health`?
